regarding the appointment process and whether consideration was made of Board representation
by a member of City Council Ward I, whose ward boundaries include the DDA District.  Mayor
Kaysen explained the mayoral appointment process he followed concerning the proposed
appointee.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present in
Council Chambers with the exception of Mayor Kaysen who did not vote (Mayoral
appointment).  Following announcement of the vote, Mr. Spiker returned to Council Chambers.
